    "description": "- Leveraged the AWS-SDK library for the development of an AWS Lambda visualization application, integrating advanced function capabilities such as metric visualization, version & alias history, and function warming. \n- Employed Vite’s rapid build process and native ES modules for development of a high-performance application.\n- Architected MongoDB with Mongoose to enable faster development that optimizes accessing, managing, and automatically storing individual user data, ensuring ease of scalability and flexibility to handle large datasets.\n- Utilized Node/Express.js to design and implement RESTful APIs, capitalizing on its flexible routing and middleware capabilities to create efficient and modular backend services.\n- Integrated Tailwind CSS to elevate the aesthetics and responsiveness of web application components, harnessing its utility-first methodology for efficiently crafting modern and engaging user interfaces. \n- Harnessed React's modular component-based architecture and state management to create repeatable dynamic and responsive user interfaces, delivering engaging and seamless user experiences.\n- Migrated 80% of the codebase to TypeScript to enhance code quality and maintainability, embracing its static typing and powerful tooling to develop robust and error-resistant software components.\n- Incorporated AWS services such as CloudWatch and CloudFormation for data tracking, IAM for ID management, S3 for stack storage, EC2 and EB to configure the environment alongside Docker for application deployment.",
