  "about": "Hi there! 👨🏻‍💻 I’m Kyle, a enthusiastic and driven Software Engineer specializing in full-stack Javascript development, React, Redux, Typescript, Node.js/Express, Tailwind CSS and SQL/NoSQL databases. I am a passionate contributor to the open-source community and enjoy applying my skills to create innovative and efficient software solutions that benefit both engineers and consumers alike!\n\n🕰️ In my most recent work, I co-created Serene, a tool for AWS developers, with features including a Lambda function warmer and visualizer for AWS logs & metrics. This open source product is focused on helping developers navigate through their AWS lambda function data and preemptively invoke their functions to best optimize time.\n\n🎤 I recently gave a public talk on Frontend Framework Alternatives (Angular) as part of Jeeny & Bractlet’s Software Engineering Speaker Series! (https://vimeo.com/862403520)\n\n🌟 Come check out some of my work on GitHub (https://github.com/khnguyen07).",
